18:53.510 --> 18:54.130
Qian Fei.

18:54.830 --> 18:55.930
Nah, komputer riba awak.

18:55.930 --> 18:56.870
Baguslah.

18:58.790 --> 19:00.850
Budak-budak, pergilah main di luar.

19:02.100 --> 19:03.330
Jom main di luar!

19:05.310 --> 19:05.720
Jom!

19:11.110 --> 19:17.370
