27:03.510 --> 27:04.240
Direktor Li.

27:04.860 --> 27:05.740
Dah jumpa.

27:11.680 --> 27:12.480
Terima kasih.

27:14.270 --> 27:15.600
Awak boleh keluar dulu.

27:20.350 --> 27:21.680
Alamat IP 33 Titik

27:21.750 --> 27:23.810
