27:48.920 --> 27:49.680
Bukanlah.

27:50.070 --> 27:50.800
Direktor Li,

27:51.030 --> 27:52.920
sejak awak beri saya petunjuk
di syarikat hari itu,

27:52.920 --> 27:55.520
