28:09.200 --> 28:10.000
Jangan risau.

28:20.400 --> 28:22.970
[Senarai Ahli Kelab Eksklusif Ritz]

28:27.640 --> 28:32.420
[Sang Shiqi]

28:40.030 --> 28:42.050
