29:05.300 --> 29:06.800
[Sang Shiqi]

30:54.880 --> 30:57.270
Bos, data-data ini belum disusun lagi.

31:01.610 --> 31:02.790
[Qian Fei]

31:09.730 --> 31:12.140
[Qian Fei]

31:12.430 --> 31:14.090
