31:40.920 --> 31:41.780
Saya faham dah.

31:44.020 --> 31:45.880
[Xin You]

31:55.550 --> 31:58.080
Abang Xin You, Qian Fei ada
di tempat awak tak?

31:58.640 --> 32:00.270
Dia pergi dengan tergesa-gesa,

32:00.270 --> 32:03.200
