paling awal untuk balik.

32:03.920 --> 32:04.440
Baik.

32:05.790 --> 32:06.590
Terima kasih.

32:10.350 --> 32:14.560
[Tianfu] [Hongqiao]

32:19.860 --> 32:24.700
[Pintu keluar]

32:51.750 --> 32:52.340
Cik,

32:53.510 --> 32:55.370
