36:04.070 --> 36:05.800
Saya... saya teman lelakinya!

36:06.280 --> 36:06.810
Qian Fei!

36:06.880 --> 36:07.740
Sini hospital!

36:07.800 --> 36:08.670
Qian Fei!

36:23.800 --> 36:24.480
Li Yifei.

36:52.680 --> 36:56.710
♪ Tak perlu sengaja
uruskan hubungan peribadi juga ♪

